// Syncthing ignore list for ~/.claude
// Managed by yadm. See vault: projects/project-machine-continuity.md
//
// Rule: yadm owns declarative config, Syncthing owns runtime state.
// Never let both manage the same file.

// --- yadm owns these: must NOT be synced by Syncthing ---
/CLAUDE.md
/settings.json
/settings.local.json
/settings.json.bak
/settings.json.orig
/skills

// --- machine-specific state: never useful on the other machine ---
/cache
/paste-cache
/telemetry
/statsig
/shell-snapshots
/session-env
/daemon
/daemon.log
/ide
/.last-cleanup

// --- reinstallable: re-fetched on demand, large and churny ---
/plugins

// --- transient locks and sockets ---
(?d)*.lock
(?d)*.sock
(?d).DS_Store

// --- everything else syncs: projects/, history.jsonl, todos/,
//     tasks/, file-history/, backups/, chrome/, jobs/
